{"id": "EUVD-2026-98933", "enisaUuid": "547b275c-aa9f-3954-93d4-d4c1eef25ebf", "description": "Jorani before 1.0.4 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in Contracts::import() that allows any authenticated user to import days off into any contract from an arbitrary URL. Attackers can submit a contract id and URL via POST to overwrite non-working-day calendars and abuse get_headers() and fopen() for server-side request forgery against internal hosts.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:53:04", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jorani/jorani/issues/426", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/blob/v1.0.2/application/controllers/Contracts.php#L358-L375", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/commit/59c403224401824489ec662934f71c90d27f614c", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/releases/tag/v1.0.4", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jorani-before-1.0.4-missing-authorization-and-ssrf-via-contracts-import"], "aliases": ["GHSA-67px-h38p-mh8v", "CVE-2026-110100"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f93bfe8f-00cd-378e-b8d1-90754660649f", "product": {"name": "Jorani", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "01773fae-9e73-3257-9e86-2fa527da3ef5", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}], "isExploited": false}